{'symbol': 'HIG', 'date': '2023-01-31 07:00:00', 'title': 'THE HARTFORD NAMED TO 2023 BLOOMBERG GENDER-EQUALITY INDEX FOR EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'HARTFORD, CONN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE HARTFORD ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS INCLUDED IN THE 2023 BLOOMBERG GENDER-EQUALITY INDEX (GEI). THIS MARKS THE EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR THE HARTFORD HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE INDEX SINCE ITS INAUGURATION IN 2016.'}